nng
------------------------------------------
This project is a rewrite of the Scalability Protocols library known as
libnanomsg, and adds significant new capabilities, while retaining
compatibility with the original.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libmbedcrypto5-2.23.0-1
  libmbedtls13-2.23.0-1
  libmbedx509_1-2.23.0-1
  libnng-devel-2.1.0-1bl1
  libnng2-2.1.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  mbedtls-devel-2.23.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/nanomsg/nng

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/nanomsg/nng/archive/refs/tags/v2.1.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack nng-2.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./nng-2.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/nng-2.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/nng-2.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnng2-2.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnng-devel-2.1.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(nng)
  /usr/bin/nngcat.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/nng.README
  /usr/share/doc/nng/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/nng/README.md

(libnng2)
  /usr/bin/cygnng-2.dll

(libnng-devel)
  /usr/include/nng/args.h
  /usr/include/nng/http.h
  /usr/include/nng/nng.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/nng/FindMbedTLS.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/nng/FindwolfSSL.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/nng/nng-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/nng/nng-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/nng/nng-targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/nng/nng-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libnng.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/nng.pc

